  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Research will undertake pieces of research that&#xa0;provide evidence and knowledge products on priority areas of work and areas with knowledge gaps across the Pacific and Development Group (PDG). Research topics will inform the&#xa0;wider PDG work programme, including topics of importance for bilateral and thematic areas.</narrative>
